@startuml WF-04_shipping_ghn
' ============================================================
' WF-04 - Shipping via GHN (carrier API)
' Source of truth: be/src/modules/shipping (quotes), be/src/modules/shipments/shipments.service.ts
'                  (create, bookCarrierParcels, applyCarrierEvent, receiveReturn),
'                  shipments/carrier-status.util.ts (GHN status mapping),
'                  marketplace-writeback/status-outbox.util.ts (status sent to AURELLE)
' Main entity state: Shipment  awaiting_pickup -> in_transit -> out_for_delivery -> delivered
'                              delivery_failed -> returning_to_warehouse -> returned_to_warehouse
'                    Order Group packed -> shipped -> delivered | returned
' ============================================================
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #333333
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #9E9E9E
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BFA76A
skinparam TitleFontSize 16

title WF-04 Shipping via GHN

|Shipping Coordinator|
|OptiPack System|
|GHN (Carrier)|
|Customer|
|Warehouse Staff|

|Shipping Coordinator|
start
:Open packed groups ready to ship;
:Compare shipping quotes
(carrier, service, fee);
:Create shipment with chosen
carrier and service;
note right
  Several groups of the same recipient
  can be shipped together as one trip.
end note

|OptiPack System|
:Create shipment (status **awaiting_pickup**),
group status **shipped**;
:Book one GHN order per parcel
(recipient of the parcel's own order);
while (Any parcel rejected by GHN?) is (yes)
  |Shipping Coordinator|
  :Correct delivery address
  (street / ward / province / phone);
  |OptiPack System|
  :Re-book parcels without tracking code;
endwhile (no)
:Store GHN tracking codes;
:Notify AURELLE customers
"waiting for carrier pickup" + tracking code;

|GHN (Carrier)|
:Pick up parcels at warehouse;
|OptiPack System|
:Receive GHN status (webhook or sync),
shipment status **in_transit**;
:Notify AURELLE customers "in transit";

|GHN (Carrier)|
:Deliver parcel to customer;
|OptiPack System|
:Shipment status **out_for_delivery**;
:Notify AURELLE customers "out for delivery";
|Customer|
while (Parcel received?) is (no)
  |GHN (Carrier)|
  :Report delivery failure with reason;
  |OptiPack System|
  :Shipment status **delivery_failed**;
  :Notify Coordinator and
  AURELLE customers (with reason);
  |GHN (Carrier)|
  if (Redeliver per carrier policy?) then (yes)
    :Deliver parcel again;
    |OptiPack System|
    :Shipment status **out_for_delivery**;
  else (no, return to sender)
    |OptiPack System|
    :Shipment status **returning_to_warehouse**;
    :Notify Store Owner, Warehouse Staff
    and AURELLE customers "returning";
    |GHN (Carrier)|
    :Return parcels to warehouse;
    |Warehouse Staff|
    :Scan "receive returned parcel";
    |OptiPack System|
    :Shipment status **returned_to_warehouse**,
    group status **returned**;
    :Create failed-delivery return ticket
    for inspection (see WF-05);
    :Notify AURELLE customers "returned";
    stop
  endif
  |Customer|
endwhile (yes)

|OptiPack System|
:Shipment status **delivered**,
group status **delivered**;
:Notify AURELLE customers "delivered"
(COD order marked paid);
stop

legend right
  Without carrier API (own fleet / mock mode) the Coordinator records
  delivered / failed manually; a 2nd failure or customer refusal
  automatically sends the shipment back to the warehouse.
  Cancelling a GHN order before pickup returns the group to packed.
endlegend
@enduml
